invariant: INV-69
file: src/mldsa_neon.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh keccak-neon
reason: the ML-DSA-87 sampler stops after four blocks of each stream. Four
  blocks hold 224 groups, fewer than 256, so every entry stops short
  and each call returns 0, where mld_sample_ntt reads up to
  MLD_SAMPLE_BLOCKS.

--- old
    for (unsigned n = 1; n < MLD_SAMPLE_BLOCKS && sampled < MLD_NEON_ENTRIES; n++) {
--- new
    for (unsigned n = 1; n < 4 && sampled < MLD_NEON_ENTRIES; n++) {
